#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""news-image-20261118 v3stack — one day of world news as a stack of newspapers.

Rebuilds the v3 front page (40 verified stories from Wednesday 18 November
2026) as the top sheet of a small stack of papers on a dark table. Two
background sheets peek out along the top edge and one down the left edge,
each with its own invented masthead, one AI photo panel and headlines drawn
from the same verified story set. No story, figure or date in this file was
copied from any earlier build script: all copy was transcribed from the
rendered v3 front page and SPEC-news18-v2.md.

Deterministic: no randomness, no clock, no network. Running this script
twice produces byte-identical entry.png.
"""
